  "description": "10 years ago, Banji and Baek-Yeong, along with his three younger siblings, spent their happiest moments together. It seemed like time would last forever. But one day, it all came crashing down and Banji and Baek-Yeong parted ways. 10 years later, the two fatefully meet again as coworkers, but Banji pushes Baek-Yeong away. As for Baek-Yeong, he is determined to reconnect with Banji because he doesn’t want to lose her again. Will Banji and Baek-Yeong be able to rekindle the relationship they once had? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS) \n\n*Note: This works was first released as a self-published work Kakao Webtoon League.*",
